questions from you all.

00:00:40.435 --> 00:00:42.730
And together we're all
dedicated to making

00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:45.280
this a welcoming
environment for everybody.

00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:46.840
So we love to hear
from everyone,

00:00:46.840 --> 00:00:49.300
no matter your level of
experience or background

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:50.920
or area of work.

00:00:50.920 --> 00:00:53.590
It is totally OK
to just listen in.

00:00:53.590 --> 00:00:57.220
There's always three ways you
can ask questions to and also

00:00:57.220 --> 00:00:59.240
provide your own perspective.

00:00:59.240 --> 00:01:03.580
So, one, you can always jump in
by raising your hand on Zoom.

00:01:03.580 --> 00:01:06.560
Two, you could put questions
into the Zoom Chat.

00:01:06.560 --> 00:01:08.860
I know you've all heard me
say this a lot of times now.

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:10.720
But feel free to
put a little star

00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:13.357
