in the Zoom chat

00:01:13.357 --> 00:01:15.190
if you want me to read
it out loud if you're

00:01:15.190 --> 00:01:18.790
in a coffee shop or something,
or if your dog's barking.

00:01:18.790 --> 00:01:21.640
But we also have a Slido link
where you can ask questions

00:01:21.640 --> 00:01:22.630
anonymously.

00:01:22.630 --> 00:01:27.010
And I think our team just shared
that in the chat right now.

00:01:27.010 --> 00:01:28.900
We'll reshare it
after for people

00:01:28.900 --> 00:01:32.890
who have joined after the
first few minutes, too.

00:01:32.890 --> 00:01:36.250
We do share the recordings of
