00:28:53.660 --> 00:28:56.750
We're working with GPT now too.

00:28:56.750 --> 00:28:58.310
Some of the things we track--

00:28:58.310 --> 00:28:59.810
total number of
tickets, how long

00:28:59.810 --> 00:29:03.990
does it take to solve
a ticket on average,

00:29:03.990 --> 00:29:06.350
what is our overall--

00:29:06.350 --> 00:29:09.290
how many tickets do
we get to within SLA.

00:29:09.290 --> 00:29:11.180
Whatever we set that at.

00:29:11.180 --> 00:29:13.410
We are very focused
on user experience.

00:29:13.410 --> 00:29:17.300
So we track CSAT, customer
CSAT and what are we

00:29:17.300 --> 00:29:22.540
hearing from users in terms
of their overall satisfaction.

00:29:22.540 --> 00:29:25.912
We look a lot to
at which tickets--

00:29:25.912 --> 00:29:27.370
by some metrics
that we have, which

00:29:27.370 --> 00:29:29.830
tickets do we think we did
really great on user experience

00:29:29.830 --> 00:29:31.930
and which ones do we think
we did really terribly,

00:29:31.930 --> 00:29:34.960
and try to expand
the first bucket

00:29:34.960 --> 00:29:36.490
and shrink the second one.

00:29:36.490 --> 00:29:37.720
So there's a lot more to it.

00:29:37.720 --> 00:29:40.720
But those are some of the
