00:29:57.310 --> 00:29:59.440
answer our support tickets.

00:29:59.440 --> 00:30:01.070
So we work with them too.

00:30:01.070 --> 00:30:02.903
But I think there's
actually a lot more room

00:30:02.903 --> 00:30:05.800
for even more data
science work there.

00:30:05.800 --> 00:30:06.300
Awesome.

00:30:06.300 --> 00:30:06.800
Thanks.

00:30:09.870 --> 00:30:12.260
Thank you.

