Thank you so much for sharing
your experience with us

00:58:15.110 --> 00:58:16.620
and answering all
of our questions.

00:58:16.620 --> 00:58:19.220
Thank you, everybody, for
the great questions as well.

00:58:20.100 --> 00:58:22.030
Great to meet you all.

00:58:22.030 --> 00:58:23.900
Have a great day, everybody.

00:58:23.900 --> 00:58:25.830
Thank you so much.

